{
  "description": "Session memory：SessionEnd 自動萃取本 session → 按專案分艙的向量庫；UserPromptSubmit→Stop 一隻綠色寵走「作業中→處理完成」；SessionEnd 藍色寵「萃取中→完成」；PreToolUse(AskUserQuestion) 起琥珀『等你回應』寵（僅在 Claude 丟問題給你選時，不接 idle/權限 Notification）；SessionStart 自動部署 usage statusLine wrapper + 補 settings.json",
  "hooks": {
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "py -3 \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/deploy_statusline.py\""
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SessionEnd": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "py -3 \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/extract_session.py\""
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "UserPromptSubmit": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "py -3 \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/session_pet.py\" --busy"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Stop": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "py -3 \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/session_pet.py\" --done"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "AskUserQuestion",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "py -3 \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/session_pet.py\" --waiting"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "AskUserQuestion",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "py -3 \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/session_pet.py\" --unwait"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
